1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,200
D, para nitrophenol.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:09,739
The nitro group withdraws electrons and spreads the phenoxide's negative charge further, stabilising it.

3
00:00:09,739 --> 00:00:16,197
Para cresol's methyl group does the opposite, and ethanol has no ring at all to spread the charge.

